--    4 rows / 3 orgs for dapr-ops-dashboard.diagrid.io.
--    NOTE: count(*) is a ROW count, not a pair count -- env is part of the key,
--    so a pair active on both hosts is stored twice (64 rows, 61 distinct pairs).
